{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7f1c2a4-9d3e-4c6b-8a10-order-notify-0001",
    "name": "FK Marketplace — Auth, Seller, CX & Admin",
    "description": "All business endpoints require a JWT Bearer token issued by the Auth Service (:8004). The token is saved to the collection variable `access_token` automatically by any Login request.\n\nSuggested flow:\n1. Auth > Register CX (customer) and Auth > Register Seller — or use the seeded Admin.\n2. Auth > Admin Login (admin@example.com / admin123) — this switches `access_token` to the admin JWT.\n3. Admin Service > Admin Dashboard (Marketplace Analytics): totals plus per-customer and per-seller analytics.\n4. Admin Service > Create Category / Create Sub-category manage the shared catalog (visible to sellers and CX).\n5. Merchant Service (seller) and Client Service (cx) mirror what those roles can do in the UI.\n\nServices: Auth :8004 · Order :8001 · Notification :8002 · Analytics :8003 · Client :8006 · Merchant :8007 · Admin :8008",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
